#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:3
#: 2e035971d8224109963bf00ab33fcfa7
msgid "折返螺旋磁序（Folded Helix）"
msgstr "Folded Helix"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:5
#: bce10b6eadcb4c1783f728bd068f3103
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:7
#: 8868239b6a974097881addf549027921
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:9
#: a4ed227f01274a0ca340a1f8940a17fb
msgid "这张卡把原子按指定方向分层，并为各层写入“逐层转动 → 到达转折点 → 反向转回”的确定性磁矩方向。输出是镜面对称或周期重复的三角相位纹理，磁矩模长保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"Divide atoms into layers along a specified direction and assign deterministic moment "
"directions that rotate layer by layer, reach a turning point, then rotate back. The "
"output is a mirror-symmetric or periodically repeated triangular phase texture, with "
"moment magnitudes unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:11
#: 21ec2884e73c4ffe9cf994845d718256
msgid "它与其他磁性卡的边界是："
msgstr "Its role differs from other magnetic cards:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:13
#: d221d7ba045145d68669533446588dc0
msgid "`SOC / Texture Response` 生成单向线性有限 q 纹理；本卡的相位是非单调折返的。"
msgstr ""
"`SOC / Texture Response` generates a one-way linear finite-q texture; this card uses "
"a nonmonotonic folded phase."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:14
#: 75ed8b210ee24973885f9027db53cbd8
msgid "`Correlated Spins` 和 `Spin Perturb` 生成随机方向；本卡没有随机性。"
msgstr ""
"`Correlated Spins` and `Spin Perturb` generate random directions; this card has no "
"randomness."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:16
#: 8401153cb4fc4b93bd837451f55ebd64
msgid "输入必须沿分层方向识别出至少 3 层，并且目标元素中至少有一个非零磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"The input must yield at least three layers along the layering direction and contain "
"at least one nonzero moment among the target elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:18
#: 0d4e6cf35ded413aa99db014c3ec2065
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:20
#: 8a28e43ec0e248ff9aa57c9d09a918f8
msgid "设按笛卡尔方向 `layer_axis` 排序后共有 $N$ 层，层号为 $k=0,\\ldots,N-1$。"
msgstr ""
"After sorting along Cartesian direction `layer_axis`, let there be $N$ layers indexed"
" by $k=0,\\ldots,N-1$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:22
#: 3121cb94bc534befb9e32ff3a6ee21a4
msgid "自动模式只在整个层堆栈上折返一次："
msgstr "Automatic mode folds only once across the full layer stack:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:24
#: 35dec1746b824375a9a94a1113bcae1b
msgid ""
"\n"
"s_{\\mathrm{auto}}(k)=\\min(k,N-1-k).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:28
#: af3a48003a274862b99c7f11419e9bc4
msgid "手动模式用半周期 $h$ 构造可重复三角波。令 $r=k\\bmod 2h$，则"
msgstr ""
"Manual mode uses a half-period $h$ to construct a repeating triangular wave. Let "
"$r=k\\bmod 2h$; then"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:30
#: 57ad710a28a647a4b6a3aed4555c805b
msgid ""
"\n"
"s_{\\mathrm{manual}}(k)=\\min(r,2h-r).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:34
#: 1d5928badcd34c1cbbc8719ef5c38b7f
msgid "第 $i$ 个原子属于第 $k_i$ 层，其相位和磁矩为"
msgstr "If atom $i$ belongs to layer $k_i$, its phase and moment are"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:36
#: e77e8aa450a74f1798ce303c7884dc19
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\phi_i=\\phi_0+\\sigma s(k_i)\\Delta\\phi,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:40
#: 7f9c72a8ab98457ca573c4ff469dc463
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf m_i=M_i\\left(\\cos\\phi_i\\,\\mathbf e_1+\n"
"\\sin\\phi_i\\,\\mathbf e_2\\right).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:45
#: 5a9a5705138f45d7b8ae8bed7f47f90c
msgid ""
"$\\mathbf e_1$、$\\mathbf e_2$ 位于 `plane_normal` 垂直的平面内；$M_i$ "
"是输入或元素表给出的磁矩模长；$\\sigma=\\pm1$ 对应两种相反的折返方向。"
msgstr ""
"$\\mathbf e_1$ and $\\mathbf e_2$ lie in the plane perpendicular to `plane_normal`; "
"$M_i$ is the moment magnitude from the input or element table; $\\sigma=\\pm1$ "
"represents the two opposite folding directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:47
#: 9bfd5812b21f4fcd8b79bc6e9dcc79b5
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:49
#: b103a6556a0e499399b058ec2afe37df
msgid "一个沿 z 方向有 8 层、每层 Fe 磁矩模长为 2 的结构，使用自动模式、每层 30°、初相位 90°时，层相位为："
msgstr ""
"For a structure with eight layers along z and Fe moment magnitude 2 in every layer, "
"automatic mode with 30° per layer and an initial phase of 90° gives layer phases:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:51
#: e30ea3bb124d4da3b1cd58310928ac90
msgid "90°, 60°, 30°, 0°, 0°, 30°, 60°, 90°\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:55
#: 0aaf6a6264aa45bd979a9680a3a7c493
msgid "选择 `Both` 会生成另一份方向相反的完整配对。检查输出时确认：同层原子方向一致、相位到中部后反向、首尾层方向相同、目标磁矩模长没有改变。"
msgstr ""
"Selecting `Both` generates a complete partner with the opposite direction. Check that"
" atoms within each layer share a direction, the phase reverses after the middle, the "
"first and last layers have the same direction, and target moment magnitudes are "
"unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:57
#: 140748b6506a401d84ecfc14ce1b864a
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:59
#: f61f1d9654e445ea978e7291f79e2bf1
msgid "层方向（layer_axis）"
msgstr "Layer Direction (layer_axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:61
#: d9a50b7193284d7e99097741c4018888
msgid "默认 `(0,0,1)`，笛卡尔方向。程序把原子位置投影到该方向后识别层；它不是 Miller 指数或晶格轴编号。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(0,0,1)`, a Cartesian direction. The program projects atomic positions onto "
"this direction to identify layers; it is neither a Miller index nor a lattice-axis "
"identifier."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:63
#: 92ffdeddeb13416e8a31aa671a0f1454
msgid "旋转平面法向（plane_normal）"
msgstr "Rotation-Plane Normal (plane_normal)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:65
#: 6f278d816e3f4e4abd3a395fd639a9a7
msgid ""
"默认跟随 `layer_axis`，因此磁矩直接在原子层面内旋转，普通用户不需要再填写第二个方向。只有选择“自定义磁矩平面”后才显示该笛卡尔向量；例如 `(0,0,1)`"
" 表示在 xy 平面旋转。旧 JSON 中与层方向不同的法向会自动恢复为自定义模式。"
msgstr ""
"By default, it follows `layer_axis`, so moments rotate directly within the atomic-"
"layer plane and most users need not enter a second direction. This Cartesian vector "
"appears only after selecting `Custom moment plane`; for example, `(0,0,1)` means "
"rotation in the xy plane. A normal in legacy JSON that differs from the layer "
"direction automatically restores custom mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:67
#: 5356c233ac064a1d9c373e876a813648
msgid "分层容差（layer_tolerance）"
msgstr "Layering Tolerance (layer_tolerance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:69
#: 516ebd6f061548caa847d2d409d9c101
msgid "默认 0.05 Å。投影距离不超过该值的原子归为同一层。过大会合并相邻层，过小会把有层内起伏的原子拆开。"
msgstr ""
"Default 0.05 Å. Atoms whose projected distances differ by no more than this value are"
" assigned to the same layer. A large value merges adjacent layers; a small value "
"splits atoms with intralayer corrugation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:71
#: 69f25f5452d24a48b0f25e69cb670ab6
msgid "半周期模式（half_period_mode）"
msgstr "half_period_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:73
#: 330fbc1046834f17aae9f6b5d96d8c74
msgid "默认 `Auto from layer count`。自动模式在检测出的完整层堆栈上折返一次；`Manual` 按指定半周期重复三角相位。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Auto from layer count`. Automatic mode folds once across the full detected "
"layer stack; `Manual` repeats the triangular phase using the specified half-period."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:75
#: 5f384870f1b545c0b3651462d632f697
msgid "半周期层步数（half_period_layers）"
msgstr "Layer Steps per Half-Period (half_period_layers)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:77
#: 228c2eef475f4a03b56ae7e019193961
msgid "默认 `(2,4,1)`，格式为 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，仅在手动模式下使用。$h=2$ 表示每经过两个层间步进到达一次转折点。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(2,4,1)`, in `[minimum, maximum, step]` form, used only in manual mode. "
"$h=2$ means that a turning point is reached after every two interlayer steps."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:79
#: 8e168ad1af674d46a628d448cd584bf9
msgid "每层角度变化（angle_step_range）"
msgstr "Angle Change per Layer (angle_step_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:81
#: eb22eb316e444415b00c47d4e0687662
msgid "默认 `(15,45,15)`°，格式为 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`。它控制相邻层的相位增量；折返点之后符号自动反转。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(15,45,15)`°, in `[minimum, maximum, step]` form. It controls the phase "
"increment between adjacent layers; the sign reverses automatically after a turning "
"point."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:83
#: 1d49bf3f55724b43a58101c71ccdc640
msgid "全局相位（phase_range）"
msgstr "Global Phase (phase_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:85
#: f7a44266656c4d4eaf1f104e6819db68
msgid "默认 `(0,0,15)`°。每个取值都会把完整折返纹理在旋转平面内整体转动，并增加一组输出。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(0,0,15)`°. Each value rotates the entire folded texture within the rotation"
" plane and adds another set of outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:87
#: 380f7dbe2d66469b900582df66c72156
msgid "折返方向（sequence_mode）"
msgstr "Folding Direction (sequence_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:89
#: 9aac90ccec734250a8b252d13d55c856
msgid "默认 `Clockwise then counterclockwise`。反向选项改变 $\\sigma$；`Both` 总是输出完整的正反方向配对，输出上限不会拆散一对。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Clockwise then counterclockwise`. The reverse option changes $\\sigma$; "
"`Both` always outputs a complete pair of opposite directions, and the output limit "
"never splits a pair."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:91
#: 9633cef9bbae4e4a9e8b4a6e89bfcc65
msgid "磁矩来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "Moment Source (magnitude_source)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:93
#: 20b60301e0084c63943248e23ce82200
msgid ""
"默认 `Existing initial magmoms`，要求输入已有非零磁矩，缺失时明确报错。选择 `Map/default magnitude` "
"后才会根据元素表建立目标磁矩模长。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Existing initial magmoms`, requiring existing nonzero moments in the input "
"and reporting an explicit error when they are absent. Target moment magnitudes are "
"built from the element table only after selecting `Map/default magnitude`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:95
#: 9998540f2c4f4fef9b3f9ef0385d8a66
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:97
#: b2f235b96d73483cbc85772816be8ab8
msgid "仅在元素表模式下使用，格式如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。"
msgstr "Used only in element-table mode, with a format such as `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:99
#: 8b456d5599354d7497b2579f09998e8a
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:101
#: 5fd7da86dd1742c1a6957cb86823c6f3
msgid "默认 0.0，仅在元素表模式下使用，作为表中未列出元素的模长。"
msgstr ""
"Default 0.0, used only in element-table mode as the magnitude for elements absent "
"from the table."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:103
#: aca3de0a167b47a6b82d9f251e4b9802
msgid "目标元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "Target Elements (apply_elements)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:105
#: 94b25d8b44324f34a050be849c43e930
msgid "默认留空，表示所有元素。可填写 `Fe,Co` 等逗号分隔符号；未选中的已有磁矩保持原方向和模长。"
msgstr ""
"Empty by default, meaning all elements. Enter comma-separated symbols such as "
"`Fe,Co`; unselected existing moments retain their original directions and magnitudes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:107
#: 9766b0ea9fe147529b2253e2ac1161d8
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:109
#: c04108e4e8c74c508d1f2e24c4438603
msgid "默认 100。理论数量为"
msgstr "Default 100. The theoretical count is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:111
#: 7a88ff1c9c8249c7b95bced0c0e13ac3
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_h\\times N_{\\Delta\\phi}\\times N_{\\phi_0}\\times N_{\\mathrm{sequence}}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:115
#: fa48abbf35ba4f4aa1abdbe05848e17e
msgid "达到上限后停止生成。`Both` 模式以两份为一组，因此奇数上限会向下取到最近的完整偶数；上限小于 2 时明确报错。"
msgstr ""
"Generation stops at the limit. `Both` mode produces pairs, so an odd limit is rounded"
" down to the nearest complete even count; a limit below 2 reports an explicit error."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:117
#: 2abeb6dd575c4f92a126a62bd8167efa
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:119
#: 307ef24261cc4fa59975f7c80ff57a1b
msgid "**为什么提示检测层数不足？** 折返至少需要“起点—转折—返回”三层。检查层方向是否正确，并确认分层容差没有把不同层合并。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are too few layers detected?** Folding requires at least three layers for "
"start, turn, and return. Check the layer direction and confirm that the layering "
"tolerance has not merged distinct layers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:121
#: dff9cf640e80435c9255b61f567086ec
msgid "**为什么输出数比理论数量少？** `max_outputs` 限制了扫描预算。界面会同时显示理论数量和预算内实际数量；`Both` 不会只保留单侧方向。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the output count smaller than the theoretical count?** `max_outputs` limits "
"the scan budget. The interface shows both the theoretical and budgeted actual counts;"
" `Both` never retains only one direction of a pair."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:123
#: 74802a9a13e147248b2abc36eaba697d
msgid "**为什么元素表没有生效？** 只有选择“元素表 / 默认值”来源后才读取该表；已有磁矩模式不会自动回退到元素表。"
msgstr ""
"**Why did the element table not take effect?** The table is read only after selecting"
" the `Element table / default` source. Existing-moment mode does not fall back to the"
" element table automatically."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:125
#: b071aa3bb0de494688a6871cbca932e2
msgid "输出"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:127
#: 9c1d017ae7944fd487dcedd99b45af8e
msgid ""
"每个成功结果写入 `spin:R:3` 并同步 ASE 初始磁矩，`Config_type` 追加 "
"`FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)`。该操作没有随机性，相同输入和参数产生相同输出。"
msgstr ""
"Every successful result is written to `spin:R:3` and synchronized with ASE initial "
"moments. `FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)` is appended to "
"`Config_type`. The operation has no randomness; identical inputs and parameters "
"produce identical outputs."

#~ msgid "折返螺旋（Folded Helix）"
#~ msgstr "Folded Helix"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按层离散定义对称折返螺旋磁矩纹理。磁矩被限制在垂直于 `plane_normal` 的平面内，沿 `layer_axis`"
#~ " 方向在前半周期逐层按固定角度旋转、到转折层后按相同步长反向旋转，形成一个\"先顺时针、到中间再逆时针\"的三角相位轮廓。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Construct a symmetric folded-helix magnetic-"
#~ "moment texture on discrete atomic layers. "
#~ "Moments are confined to the plane normal "
#~ "to `plane_normal`. Along `layer_axis`, they rotate"
#~ " by a fixed angle from one layer to"
#~ " the next during the first half-period, "
#~ "then reverse by the same increment after "
#~ "the turning layer. The result is a "
#~ "triangular phase profile that rotates in one"
#~ " direction and folds back at the midpoint."

#~ msgid "`Plane Normal` = `[0, 0, 1]`（磁矩在 xy 面内旋转）"
#~ msgstr "`Plane Normal` = `[0, 0, 1]` (rotate moments in the *xy* plane)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果 auto 模式给出的半周期不合适——比如你的结构有 10 层但 auto 给了 "
#~ "h=4——切到 manual 模式手动指定 `half_period_layers`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If automatic mode chooses an unsuitable "
#~ "half-period—for example, `h=4` for a ten-"
#~ "layer structure—switch to manual mode and set"
#~ " `half_period_layers` explicitly."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `'Auto from layer count'`。`Auto from "
#~ "layer count` 由当前层数自动推导半周期，保证首尾闭合（大多数情况推荐这个）。`Manual` 手动指定 "
#~ "`half_period_layers` 扫描范围，适合比较不同折返周期。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `'Auto from layer count'`. "
#~ "`Auto from layer count` derives a half-"
#~ "period from the detected layers and closes "
#~ "the phase between the first and last "
#~ "layers; this is recommended in most cases. "
#~ "`Manual` scans the range set by "
#~ "`half_period_layers` and is useful for comparing "
#~ "different folded periods."

